  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 3 December 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nWhether your priority is family first or managing a challenging career, this secluded and spacious family haven is exactly what you are looking for.\r\n\r\nThis luxury home features:\r\n\r\n  - Four full-sized bedrooms\r\n  - A large, sunny lounge with a separate family room\r\n  - Three parking spaces, including a garage\r\n  - A covered, sheltered, and north-facing entertainment area, conveniently located opposite the Ryman Retirement Complex\r\n\r\nWhile our vendors have immensely enjoyed their time here, they now have an opportunity to upsize to accommodate extended family. This lovely home sold very quickly last time and offers far more than you might expect.\r\n\r\nPlease call me today to arrange a viewing.",
